msgctxt "64"
msgid "Do you need something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Oh, no⑬I was just reading this article..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"(The Millennium Tower bombing? That magazine must be three years old. Looks "
"like I'm in it...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Yeah. That's me, all right. What of it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"No, well, it's not you... I'm looking for this man. The one behind you in "
"this picture."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "He's my father... and he's been gone for fourteen years!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"He used to run a money-lending company in Kamurocho. But fourteen years "
"ago, he shut it all down and went into hiding..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "I've been looking for him ever since."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "So that's your dad?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Yeah... I couldn't believe it when I first saw this article, a couple years "
"back. It's him, all right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"I thought he might be somewhere in Kamurocho, so I came here, but... so "
"far, nobody's recognized him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Then I saw you at this convenience store⑬the man in the picture with my "
"father..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "(The guy in this photo does look kind of familiar...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Is something wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Just thinking. You could try asking the person who took this photo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Oh... You might be right! But how would I reach them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Just call the magazine's editorial desk. They should know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Oh, right... Of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Huh? Ah, crap... The battery's dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Fine... I can make the call. Pass that magazine."
msgstr ""

